TITLE 1D transport with exchange, query solution 3 activity
SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -solution true
    -activities Na+
END